# Section padding

Use the shared Tailwind utility `section` for vertical padding on marketing page sections.

- **Class:** `section`
- **Equals:** `py-28 md:py-40` (homepage rhythm)
- **Defined in:** `src/app/globals.css` (`@utility section`)

## Do

- Put `section` on `<section>` (or equivalent band) for standard content blocks.
- Prefer `className="section …"` over hand-rolled `py-28 md:py-40` or `py-20 md:py-28`.

## Don't

- Invent new vertical padding scales for page sections (`py-16`, `py-20 md:py-28`, etc.) unless the block is explicitly not a standard section (e.g. sticky subnav, full-bleed seam, hero under `main.pt-14` that needs a tighter first-screen top).
- Mix homepage spacing with a different scale on other marketing pages.
